  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Kilo Code is an AI coding agent available for VS Code, JetBrains IDEs, and as a CLI, installable via npm, curl, pnpm, bun, Homebrew, and AUR. The CLI ships as platform binaries for Windows, macOS (Intel and Apple Silicon), and Linux x64/ARM, including a musl build for Alpine and a non-AVX baseline build for older CPUs.",
